    "## 2. 手算验证：RNN 前向传播\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### 小型序列手算\\n",
    "\\n",
    "设词汇表大小 $V=3$，隐状态维度 $H=2$，序列长度 $T=3$。\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**权重：**\\n",
    "$$W_{xh} = \\\\begin{bmatrix} 0.1 & 0.2 \\\\\\\\ 0.3 & 0.4 \\\\end{bmatrix}, \\\\quad W_{hh} = \\\\begin{bmatrix} 0.5 & 0.1 \\\\\\\\ 0.2 & 0.3 \\\\end{bmatrix}, \\\\quad b_h = [0, 0]$$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**输入序列（one-hot 编码）：**\\n",
    "$$x_1 = [1, 0], \\\\quad x_2 = [0, 1], \\\\quad x_3 = [1, 0]$$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**初始隐状态：** $h_0 = [0, 0]$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**时间步 1：**\\n",
    "$$z_1 = W_{xh} x_1 + W_{hh} h_0 + b_h = [0.1, 0.3] + [0, 0] = [0.1, 0.3]$$\\n",
    "$$h_1 = \\\\tanh(z_1) = [\\\\tanh(0.1), \\\\tanh(0.3)] = [0.0997, 0.2913]$$\\n",
