    "$$= [0.2, 0.4] + [0.0788, 0.1073] = [0.2788, 0.5073]$$\\n",
    "$$h_2 = \\\\tanh(z_2) = [\\\\tanh(0.2788), \\\\tanh(0.5073)] = [0.2716, 0.4672]$$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**时间步 3：**\\n",
    "$$z_3 = W_{xh} x_3 + W_{hh} h_2 = [0.1, 0.3] + [0.5 \\\\times 0.2716 + 0.1 \\\\times 0.4672, \\\\; 0.2 \\\\times 0.2716 + 0.3 \\\\times 0.4672]$$\\n",
    "$$= [0.1, 0.3] + [0.1825, 0.1945] = [0.2825, 0.4945]$$\\n",
